# Local Worker dev overrides for `wrangler dev` (copy to `.dev.vars`).
#
# Artsonia has NO app-level API credentials — each user's own Artsonia email +
# password arrive through the connector's OAuth login form (served at
# /authorize), not from here, and are stored encrypted per-user in OAUTH_KV.
# There is nothing required in this file to run the hosted connector locally; it
# exists only as the conventional place for any future Worker-only dev override.
